<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physicians Health cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physicians Health cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said analyst Christine Bennis lowered the rating on Physicians Health Services Inc to hold from buy, citing the stock price.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/64 to 27-11/64.</p>
